{"id":"n58271-2-12","stage":0,"title":"헤어지다 · 分手","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58271-2-12-1","ko":"무슨 안 좋은 일이 있었나요?","zh":"发生什么不好的事情了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"무슨","meaning":"什么","explanation":"무슨：疑问限定词，询问发生了什么不好的事。","readings":[{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66237","senseId":"1","lemma":"무슨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"무슨","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"좋은","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋은","audio":"/audio/dc3caaaf06a600dc6306.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"있었나요?","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있었나요","audio":"/audio/649a44473af254104b23.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"41abb599007a8f8a","term":"무슨","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/41abb599007a8f8a3050.mp3","entryId":"66237","definition":"用于询问不确定或不知道的事情、对象、东西等。","pronunciation":["무슨"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"所处的情形或状况。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e6e940c66c3435fae606.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58271-2-12-2","ko":"애인과 헤어져서 요즘 힘들어요.","zh":"我和恋人分手了，最近过得很辛苦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"애인과","meaning":"恋人","explanation":"애인：恋人；-과 标记分手所涉及的对象，애인과 헤어지다 是“和恋人分手”。","readings":[{"term":"애인","audio":"/audio/97aae2f9eae59ad11035.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73134","senseId":"1","lemma":"애인","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"애인과","audio":"/audio/029724875cf51a9564eb.mp3"}},{"text":"헤어져서","meaning":"分手，分开，走开","explanation":"헤어지다：分手，分开，走开；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"헤어지다","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58271","senseId":"2","lemma":"헤어지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤어져서","audio":"/audio/47186d55661b0a2abb6d.mp3"}},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子。","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들어요.","meaning":"艰难，困难","explanation":"힘들다：艰难，困难；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"4","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들어요","audio":"/audio/4a12b91b791e4b24165f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"97aae2f9eae59ad1","term":"애인","zh":"恋人","audio":"/audio/97aae2f9eae59ad11035.mp3","entryId":"73134","definition":"处于恋爱关系的人；本句指已分手的恋人。","pronunciation":["애ː인"]},{"id":"55df2acaad2147f2","term":"헤어지다","zh":"分手，分开，走开","audio":"/audio/55df2acaad2147f202aa.mp3","entryId":"58271","definition":"和亲近的人切断关系。","pronunciation":["헤어지다"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"8eec39c3609a6c71","term":"힘들다","zh":"艰难，困难","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3","entryId":"91737","definition":"状况或情况等不宽裕，难。","pronunciation":["힘들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/01676a8420f3bdfd7c4a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.62,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=58271","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":21,"sequenceScore":0.8361,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我和恋人分手了，最近过得很辛苦。","发生什么不好的事情了吗？","行李要搬到哪儿去呢？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["发生什么不好的事情了吗？","行李要搬到哪儿去呢？","我和恋人分手了，最近过得很辛苦。"],"answer":2}]}
